{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778710/extras/WotHTwoWorldsCropped1200400.gif?t=1748540075\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>This demo includes the opening act of the story, featuring the initial section of the map, puzzles, and collectibles.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Two Timelines, One Mystery</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore both modern and medieval versions of the same city. Unravel a mystery shaped by centuries-old rivalry.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Interact with the Past \u2014 as a Ghost</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can\u2019t speak. You can\u2019t be seen. But you can affect the world. Solve puzzles by influencing objects and environments across time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778710/extras/WotHPuzzleGif610.gif?t=1748540075\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Atmospheric, Puzzle-Focused Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No combat. Just thoughtful exploration, rich storytelling and puzzle solving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Curse That Won\u2019t Let Go</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover the origin of a time-warping curse born from desperation, and follow the path of an ancient rivalry between thieves and pirates.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Stylized Comic Panel Cutscenes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into a unique visual narrative told through comic book panels.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Will you escape the curse\u2026 or remain just a whisper?</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778710/extras/postermain1800.jpg?t=1748540075\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3778710?t=1748540075","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778710/641a07e5e7bf400c88a35fc5c92fe31b2ee9ef3d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748540075","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778710/ce54134cd350592573aa235e0b0548b5017e2d18/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748540075","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778710/ce54134cd350592573aa235e0b0548b5017e2d18/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748540075","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778710/extras/WotHTwoWorldsCropped1200400.gif?t=1748540075\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>This demo includes the opening act of the story, featuring the initial section of the map, puzzles, and collectibles.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Two Timelines, One Mystery</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore both modern and medieval versions of the same city. Unravel a mystery shaped by centuries-old rivalry.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Interact with the Past \u2014 as a Ghost</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can\u2019t speak. You can\u2019t be seen. But you can affect the world. Solve puzzles by influencing objects and environments across time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>